# Journey: a member asks for a plan, and scout posts a day-by-day itinerary
# paced to the group, offering what only one person wants as an add-on.
# Needs Claude (or OpenAI).
members maya leo priya
from destination-chosen

maya: @scout heads up, all three of us are night owls
expect state members ~ "night owl"
leo: @scout i really want to go scuba diving, nobody else is into it lol
priya: @scout can you make us a plan?
expect scout ~ "the plan"
expect state itinerary ~ "2027-03-14"
expect state itinerary_add_ons ~ "leo"
